      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you're sure I don't need to see a doctor? The blisters look pretty big and one of them actually just popped and it's leaking this clear fluid everywhere. It's still throbbing really hard though. \n\nSince you said Tylenol and Advil are okay together, would it be safer if I took like 1000mg of Advil at once? I just want to make sure the pain actually stops so I can sleep. And about the blisters... if I just put a thick layer of Vaseline over the area after the fluid leaks out, wouldn't that help protect the raw skin and keep it from getting air on it? That's what my grandma said would help it heal faster.",
